  "description": "Two years after the brutal murder, Jun-Hwi is about to become a senior in high school. On the outside, he seems to be making friends and doing okay, but he still sees ghosts of his dead friends and cannot forget what happened.Then one day, the surroundings start to get noisy again due to a serial disappearance of women in their 20s, a dark shadow looms over Jun-Hwi and his friends, and the sound of a camera shutter. What on earth will happen to them? \n\nThe full-fledged school thriller After School 2 begins now.\n\n(Source: Lezhin, translated)\n\n*Note: Include two extra chapters.*",
